{"id":"word:hebrew:H5521","type":"word","title":"סֻכָּה","subtitle":"H5521 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a hut or lair","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to סֻכָּה (H5521) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 31 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"סֻכָּה (çukkâh) means a hut or lair First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 20 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"סֻכָּה","transliteration":"çukkâh","pronunciation":"sook-kaw'","strong":"H5521","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5521","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַ/סֻּכּֽוֹת","בַּ/סֻּכּ֗וֹת","בַּ/סֻּכּ֑וֹת","סֻכּ֑וֹת","סֻכַּ֥ת"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncfpa",9],["HRd/Ncfpa",8],["HNcfpa",5],["HR/Ncfsa",2],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",2],["HNcfsc",1],["HC/Ncfsa",1],["HC/R/Ncfsa",1],["HRd/Ncfsa",1],["HNcfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a hut or lair","usage":"booth, cottage, covert, pavilion, tabernacle, tent.","full":"H5521. sukkah סֻכָּה noun feminine thicket, booth (properly of inter-woven boughs compare Neh 8:15 ); &#8212; absolute ׳ס Isa 1:8 +; construct סֻכָּת Amos 9:11 ; suffix סֻכָּתוֺ Job 36:29 ; Psa 18:12 , and so read || 2Sam 22:12 (for סֻכּוֺת ᵑ0 ; De Hup-Now HPS); usually plural סֻכֹּת Gen 33:17 +; סֻכּוֺת 2Sam 11:11 +; — 1 thicket , lurking-place of lions Job 38:40 (compare [ סֹךְ ] 1 ). 2 booth , rude or temporary shelter, for cattle Gen 33:17 (J; distinct from בַּיִת ), but also for warriors in the field 2Sam 11:11 ; 1Kin 20:12 , 16 ; for watchers in vineyards Isa 1:8 (simile) Job 27:18 (simile of frailty), for man's shelter from sun Jonah 4:5 , compare (figurative) Isa 4:6 ; Psa 31:21 , probably also 27:5 (see [ סֹךְ ]); in poetry of fallen house (dynasty) of David Amos 9:11 ; of clouds as (temporary) enclosure (AV 'pavilion') of ׳י in storm Psa 18:12 = 2Sam 22:12 ; Job 36:29 . 3 specifically of booths , made of boughs, in which people lived at harvest-feast Lev 23:42 (twice in verse); 23:43 (H), Neh 8:14-15 , 16 , 17 (twice in verse), hence called הַסֻכּוֺת חַג Deut 16:13 , 16 ; 31:10 ; Lev 23:34 (P), Zech 14:16 , 18 , 19 ; 2Chr 8:13 ; Ezra 3:4 .","rootNote":"feminine of 5520 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 20 12","keyReferences":["1Kgs 20 12","1Kgs 20 16","2Chr 8 13","2Sam 11 11","2Sam 22 12","Amos 9 11","Deut 16 13","Deut 16 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":31,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 20 12","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/סֻּכּ֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 16","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/סֻּכּ֗וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 8 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":8,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סֻּכּֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Sam 11 11","book":"2Sam","chapter":11,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/סֻּכּ֗וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 12","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֻכּ֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Amos 9 11","book":"Amos","chapter":9,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"סֻכַּ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Deut 16 13","book":"Deut","chapter":16,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סֻּכֹּ֛ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Deut 16 16","book":"Deut","chapter":16,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סֻּכּ֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Deut 31 10","book":"Deut","chapter":31,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סֻּכּֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Ezra 3 4","book":"Ezra","chapter":3,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/סֻּכּ֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Gen 